
Scenario 1: Wired Network (Ethernet)
User opens Google
        │
        ▼
+---------------------+
| Application Layer   |
| HTTP Request        |
+---------------------+
        │
        ▼
+---------------------+
| Transport Layer     |
| TCP                 |
| Src Port            |
| Dst Port            |
| Seq Number          |
| Ack Number          |
+---------------------+
        │
        ▼
+---------------------+
| Network Layer       |
| IP                  |
| Src IP              |
| Dst IP              |
+---------------------+
        │
        ▼
Need to send outside subnet?
        │
      YES
        │
        ▼
ARP Request
"Who has Gateway IP?"
        │
        ▼
Gateway replies with MAC
        │
        ▼
+---------------------+
| Ethernet Frame      |
| Src MAC             |
| Dst MAC (Gateway)   |
+---------------------+
        │
        ▼
══════════════════════════════
 Ethernet Cable
══════════════════════════════
        │
        ▼
Switch
        │
(Looks only at Destination MAC)
        │
        ▼
Router
        │
(Removes Ethernet Header)
        │
(Check Destination IP)
        │
(Create NEW Ethernet Header)
        │
        ▼
Next Hop
        │
        ▼
Destination PC
        │
(Removes all headers)
        │
        ▼
Application receives data


